Package: rENM
Type: Package
Title: Top-level orchestration for the rENM framework
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "John L.", family = "Schnase",
    email = "rENM.Framework@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7473-3977"))
Description: Provides the top-level rENM() function, which executes the
    complete retrospective ecological niche modeling pipeline for a single
    species by orchestrating the installed rENM framework packages in
    sequence -- from occurrence extraction and environmental variable
    preparation through ensemble modeling, suitability trend analysis,
    AI-assisted interpretation, and final report assembly.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
